WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.473
Your app works.

2
00:00:01.473 --> 00:00:04.652
Now you want it on Google Play and the App Store.

3
00:00:04.652 --> 00:00:06.274
The stores ask for a lot.

4
00:00:06.274 --> 00:00:08.675
Here is the path, one step at a time.

5
00:00:10.275 --> 00:00:10.880
Step one.

6
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:11.889
Make your plan.

7
00:00:11.889 --> 00:00:13.503
Type shipvo store setup.

8
00:00:13.503 --> 00:00:16.261
It asks if you have a registered company.

9
00:00:16.261 --> 00:00:21.709
With a company, you get organization accounts, and no tester rule on Google Play.

10
00:00:21.709 --> 00:00:26.350
Without one, you get a personal account, and the tester rule applies.

11
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:28.558
Step two.

12
00:00:28.558 --> 00:00:30.246
Type shipvo store status.

13
00:00:30.246 --> 00:00:32.677
You see one timeline for each store.

14
00:00:32.677 --> 00:00:35.243
Every step is to do, waiting, or done.

15
00:00:35.243 --> 00:00:37.201
It tells you what to do next.

16
00:00:37.201 --> 00:00:39.700
When you finish a step, mark it done.

17
00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:42.684
Step three.

18
00:00:42.684 --> 00:00:45.552
The stores ask what data your app collects.

19
00:00:45.552 --> 00:00:48.553
Type shipvo store details --dry-run.

20
00:00:48.553 --> 00:00:55.023
Shipvo reads the features your app uses, and drafts the data safety answers and a privacy policy.

21
00:00:55.023 --> 00:01:00.425
Some questions only you can answer, like third-party tools and a contact address.

22
00:01:02.025 --> 00:01:02.684
Step four.

23
00:01:02.684 --> 00:01:03.475
Screenshots.

24
00:01:03.475 --> 00:01:05.453
Type shipvo store screenshots.

25
00:01:05.453 --> 00:01:11.254
Shipvo shows your app in the simulator, and saves files in the sizes the stores ask for.

26
00:01:11.254 --> 00:01:12.506
It checks each one.

27
00:01:12.506 --> 00:01:18.175
This is a simulator picture, not the native screen, so look at them before you submit.

28
00:01:19.775 --> 00:01:25.998
On Google Play with a personal account, you also need twelve testers for fourteen days in a row.

29
00:01:25.998 --> 00:01:28.591
Type shipvo store testers for the steps.

30
00:01:28.591 --> 00:01:32.804
Shipvo Testers is a group of founders who test each other's apps.

31
00:01:32.804 --> 00:01:34.425
We have a video about it.

32
00:01:36.025 --> 00:01:37.758
Be clear about what this is.

33
00:01:37.758 --> 00:01:40.667
Shipvo does not upload your app to a store yet.

34
00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.019
It does not touch your store accounts.

35
00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:47.723
It tells you what to do, in order, drafts the answers, and checks the sizes.

36
00:01:47.723 --> 00:01:48.775
You press submit.

37
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:51.775
Start with your plan.

38
00:01:51.775 --> 00:01:54.642
Type shipvo store setup in your app folder.

39
00:01:54.642 --> 00:01:57.575
The guide is at shipvo.dev/learn.
